    <string name="settings_diagnostics_hint">If you enabled it in Settings but the line above still says it is off, compare the two values below — they show the service name the system stored against the name this app looks for.</string>
    <string name="settings_bubble_hint">The TA bubble floats over the screen while the background service runs: tap to open the translation panel, long-press for the quick menu (pause, language, settings, hide, exit), drag to move it. While a translation is showing it turns into a red ✕ to dismiss it.</string>
